  "description": "The Huffy Centuric is built for riders who want electric power in a compact, easy-to-manage package. Its 20-inch folding design makes it simple to store at home, bring along in a vehicle, or save space when not in use.\nA 350W electric motor delivers smooth, responsive assistance to help reduce effort on hills and longer rides. Whether cruising city streets or handling daily commutes, the Centuric adds confidence to every ride.\nA Shimano 6-speed drivetrain gives riders flexibility to adjust to changing terrain. Easy-to-use twist shifting keeps gear changes simple and reliable.\nFront and rear disc brakes provide dependable stopping power, while wide tires add stability and grip. Integrated front and rear lights help improve visibility for everyday riding.\nA rear rack supports carrying essentials, and the folding frame keeps the bike practical for daily life. The Centuric is designed to fit seamlessly into commuting, errands, and casual rides.",
